Key Principles
- Use firebase SDK to comunicate with backend services
- Use ReactQuery [frontend-react-react_query.mdc](mdc:fitness-engine/.cursor/rules/frontend-react-react_query.mdc)
- Organize files using modules

Component Development
- Create .tsx files for React components
- Implement proper component composition and reusability.
- Use component props for data passing.

Routing and Pages
- Use https://tanstack.com/router/latest
- Directory src/routes

Styling
- Prefer Tailwind CSS for styling components
- Leverage global styles when necessary, importing them in layouts. [frontend-styling-tailwind.mdc](mdc:fitness-engine/.cursor/rules/frontend-styling-tailwind.mdc)

Tailwind CSS Best Practices
- Use Tailwind utility classes in components.
- Leverage Tailwind's responsive design utilities (sm:, md:, lg:, etc.).
- Utilize Tailwind's color palette and spacing scale for consistency.
- Avoid using the @apply directive

Performance Optimization
- Implement proper lazy loading for images and other assets.
- Utilize built-in asset optimization features.

Accessibility
- Ensure proper semantic HTML structure in all components.
- Implement ARIA attributes where necessary.
- Implement proper ARIA labels and roles for components.
- Ensure keyboard navigation support for interactive elements.
- Ensure color contrast ratios meet WCAG standards for readability.